OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing 82-year-old in
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted killing an
OL,7,F82-year-old who was found with stab
OL,8,Fwounds in Derby.
OL,10,FGerard Ring was attacked in Whitecross
OL,11,FGardens, off Kedleston Road, at about
OL,12,F14:20 BST on 6 September last year.
OL,14,FJulian Donoher, 51, of Whitecross
OL,15,FGardens, appeared at Derby Crown Court
OL,16,Fon Monday, when he denied murder but
OL,17,Fpleaded guilty to manslaughter by
OL,18,Freason of diminished responsibility.
OL,20,FJudge Shaun Smith KC has told Donoher
OL,21,Fhe will be sentenced on 22 September.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
